---
import HumanHub from "./HumanHub.astro";
---

<div class="molding-divider molding-divider-flip" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<section class="relative bg-muted bg-paper wash-ochre-bl py-24 md:py-32 section-inset-soft" aria-labelledby="problem-heading">
  <canvas data-underline-canvas class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-8">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">

      <!-- Left column: text -->
      <div class="max-w-xl">
        <h2 id="problem-heading" class="ink-reveal text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground leading-[1.15] md:text-4xl">
          Your team is the <span data-marker-line>glue between your systems.</span>
          <br />
          It shouldn't be.
        </h2>
        <p class="ink-reveal mt-6 text-muted-foreground md:text-lg leading-relaxed" style="--reveal-delay: 120">
          Retail supply chain teams spend their days chasing updates, syncing spreadsheets, and nudging work along across ERPs, PLM tools, messengers, and email. Deadlines slip. Handoffs get dropped. And it only gets worse as you scale.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right column: Human Hub graphic -->
      <HumanHub />

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="molding-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
